      "message": "The VINTF check currently fails in CI:\n\n```\n...INFO] Fetch \u0027out/target/product/vsoc_arm64_only/obj/PACKAGING/check_vintf_all_intermediates/apex/com.android.hardware.keymint/etc/vintf/android.hardware.security.keymint-service.trusty.system.xml\u0027: OK\ngetDeviceHalManifest: status from fetching VINTF information: -2147483648\n...efault (@4) (from /apex/com.android.hardware.keymint/etc/vintf/android.hardware.security.keymint-service.trusty.system.xml). Check whether or not multiple modules providing the same HAL are installed.\nERROR: Cannot fetch vendor manifest.\n```\n\nThis failure likely occurs because the declaration is already included here as `vintf_fragments`. Consequently, no other apex can include it again, even as `prebuilt_etc`. A potential solution is to include the VINTF target as `prebuilt` within all apexes requiring it, similar to how KeyMint apexes are handled on cuttlefish.",
